{
 "id": "mono",
 "order": 17,
 "name": "Monom: monophonic synth machine",
 "description": [
  "9th machine \"Monom\": a monophonic synth in the spirit of SH-101 / Minimoog / Pro-One / MS-20, warm and imperfect",
  "(own code). COLOR = wave (SAW SQR PWM S+P TRI SYNC DTN RING), SHAPE = timbre of the wave, SWEEP = sub oscillator,",
  "CONTOUR = drive, FUNC + PITCH = glide, FUNC + CONTOUR = noise, GATE = hold while the trig / note lasts (like TONE).",
  "Oscillator drift, random detune per note,",
  "free-running phases, soft saturation. Use the track filter (patch 12) as its filter.",
  "Needs Grit and Vlvt (patches 15, 16)."
 ],
